]},{"type":"p","text":"No internet needed to collect, process, present and store the plant’s data.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"No cloud storage charges","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"A one-time investment. Your plant data stays on your server, not in a third-party cloud.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"One ETi-LOG and one computer","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Needs just one ETi-LOG and one computer at the plant, running Windows or Linux.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Remote access","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Head office reaches the plant data 24/7 through web hosting or a web client.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Daily backup","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"An incremental backup every day keeps the data safe if the server or its operating system crashes.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Real-time alerts","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Alerts for equipment breakdowns, faults and failures, as they happen.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Inverter ranking","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Ranks every inverter against the others on 7 parameters, so low performers get corrective action.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Downtime tracking","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Tracks grid and inverter downtime from day one, for the life of the plant.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Custom graphs and reports","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Plot any equipment and any parameter, and download reports and data as XLS, PDF or PNG.","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"ETi-EDGE","links":[]},{"type":"h2","text":"Designed for","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Utilities","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Government, SLDC or secured facilities: SCADA on your own server, without internet.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Limited connectivity","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"A local SCADA server for plants with limited internet connectivity.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"No cloud charges","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"No annual cloud server charges to view y